# No Railway push without asking

- Do **not** push to Railway, trigger Railway deploys, or run Railway deploy/CLI push commands unless the user **explicitly** asks for it in the current message.
- Git push to remotes that auto-deploy to Railway also requires an explicit ask.
- After finishing code changes, stop at local work (or a normal commit only if the user asked for a commit). Do not deploy or push “to finish” on your own.
